// _ds_bundle.js (IIFE \u2192 window.<Namespace> with a first-line \`/* @ds-bundle:\r
// {...} */\` header), root styles.css, per-component .d.ts/.prompt.md/<Name>.html.\r
// The claude.ai/design app's self-check regenerates the adherence config and\r
